<div class="faq-answer-template--23901885038921__ss_faq_17_Edg7ad" style="display: none; height: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
<p>All items are dispatched from our warehouse within 48 hours of placing your order, during business hours. If you place an order on a Friday afternoon or over the weekend, it will be sent out on the next business day. We are closed on public holidays, so please take this into account when placing an order.</p>
</div>
